    {
      "id": "seg:paragraph:discussion:0008:0001",
      "source": "Each vector in the buffer is of the type defined by [`format`](argeometrysource/format.md).",
      "ko": "The framework clamps this to between `0` and `30` Hz.",
      "sourceHash": "899761ca513b51448054d67e772f76d964af441c3e093b66bd2aa9420d1247de",
      "status": "machine_translated"
    },
    {
      "id": "seg:paragraph:discussion:0008:0002",
      "source": "Every vector may itself contain multiple scalars, defined by [`componentsPerVector`](argeometrysource/componentspervector.md).",
      "ko": "각 벡터에는 [`componentsPerVector`](argeometrysource/componentspervector.md)에서 정의된 여러 스칼라가 포함될 수 있습니다.",
      "sourceHash": "e73a2a5e5717b4fd2bad504c850327431bcfb0e63e5c2e3fbd81f5394dd9312d",
      "status": "machine_translated"
    },
    {
      "id": "seg:paragraph:discussion:0009:0001",
      "source": "The buffer’s [`storageMode`](https://developer.apple.com/documentation/Metal/MTLResource/storageMode) is [`MTLStorageMode.shared`](https://developer.apple.com/documentation/Metal/MTLStorageMode/shared) which allows it to be accessed on both, the CPU, and GPU.",
      "ko": "Otherwise, ARKit automatically corrects the image anchor’s transform when `estimatedScaleFactor` is a value other than 1.0.",
      "sourceHash": "80b77b2f79611f56ea4022fe2f8f17c9f24aed3ce47c5c2034c4495a4c598f7f",
      "status": "machine_translated"
    },
